WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.006 --> 00:00:04.396 line:3%
  You have been invited to look at  
  a private investment opportunity.  

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.068 line:3%
  Bulma is leading an SPV into Senzu Labs.  

3
00:00:09.052 --> 00:00:09.820 line:3%
  She sets up the deal.  

4
00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:14.089 line:3%
  An operations team approves it before  
  anyone sees it. Then she goes live.  

5
00:00:15.152 --> 00:00:18.309 line:3%
  She invites investors by link, and  
  each link carries its own terms.  

6
00:00:22.177 --> 00:00:24.652 line:3%
  Forward an email invitation,  
  and anyone else is told:  

7
00:00:25.206 --> 00:00:27.511 line:3%
  this invitation was sent  
  to another email address.  

8
00:00:28.691 --> 00:00:31.951 line:3%
  One of them, Goku, confirms  
  he is eligible, sees the deal,  

9
00:00:31.951 --> 00:00:34.536 line:3%
  and the exact amount to  
  pay before he commits.  

10
00:00:35.691 --> 00:00:39.360 line:3%
  Then his identity check and his signature.  
  Only then does he see where to pay.  

11
00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:42.733 line:3%
  Then the terms change,  
  and Goku gets an email.  

12
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.938 line:3%
  Do not send money: your earlier payment  
  instructions are no longer valid.  

13
00:00:48.922 --> 00:00:51.823 line:3%
  He sees what changed, confirms,  
  and gets new instructions.  

14
00:00:53.063 --> 00:00:55.239 line:3%
  Only the operations team  
  records what has arrived.  

15
00:00:56.503 --> 00:00:59.575 line:3%
  She sees every investor: the  
  step, and who it waits on.  

16
00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:02.070 line:3%
  Vegeta.  

17
00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.770 line:3%
  More modules on the way.  
